 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa, where do my photos",
   "s": 0,
   "e": 0.88,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "go when I upload them?",
   "s": 0.94,
   "e": 2.1,
   "line": 1,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "To a building full of computers.",
   "s": 2.16,
   "e": 3.81,
   "line": 2,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "A building?",
   "s": 3.92,
   "e": 4.62,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "I thought they went",
   "s": 4.68,
   "e": 5.08,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "to the cloud.",
   "s": 5.14,
   "e": 5.9,
   "line": 3,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "The cloud is a building.",
   "s": 5.96,
   "e": 7.45,
   "line": 4,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a real cloud?",
   "s": 7.52,
   "e": 8.75,
   "line": 5,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "No. Just a huge",
   "s": 8.96,
   "e": 10.26,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "room of computers,",
   "s": 10.32,
   "e": 11.3,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "with a lot of fans",
   "s": 11.36,
   "e": 12.24,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "to keep them cool.",
   "s": 12.3,
   "e": 13.29,
   "line": 6,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Whose computers?",
   "s": 13.54,
   "e": 14.33,
   "line": 7,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "A company's.",
   "s": 14.52,
   "e": 15.31,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Google, Apple, Amazon.",
   "s": 15.38,
   "e": 17.03,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "You just rent a little space.",
   "s": 17.2,
   "e": 18.47,
   "line": 8,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So my photos live",
   "s": 18.6,
   "e": 19.32,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "in someone else's computer?",
   "s": 19.38,
   "e": 20.85,
   "line": 9,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Yes. And they keep spare copies.",
   "s": 21.02,
   "e": 23.19,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "If one computer breaks,",
   "s": 23.48,
   "e": 24.74,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "your photos are still safe.",
   "s": 24.8,
   "e": 26.37,
   "line": 10,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a spare key?",
   "s": 26.54,
   "e": 27.56,
   "line": 11,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Exactly like a spare key.",
   "s": 27.62,
   "e": 28.84,
   "line": 12,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So that's why I can",
   "s": 28.9,
   "e": 29.96,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "open them on any phone.",
   "s": 30.02,
   "e": 31.35,
   "line": 13,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Right. Your phone doesn't",
   "s": 31.62,
   "e": 32.64,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "keep the photo.",
   "s": 32.7,
   "e": 33.44,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "It just shows it to you.",
   "s": 33.5,
   "e": 34.79,
   "line": 14,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the cloud is just...",
   "s": 34.88,
   "e": 36.1,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "someone else's computer.",
   "s": 36.16,
   "e": 37.66,
   "line": 15,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now you've got it.",
   "s": 37.72,
   "e": 38.62,
   "line": 16,
   "sp": "A"
  },
  {
   "text": "Does the building know",
   "s": 38.68,
   "e": 39.26,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "I took forty selfies?",
   "s": 39.32,
   "e": 40.53,
   "line": 17,
   "sp": "B"
  },
  {
   "text": "Forty-one.",
   "s": 40.68,
   "e": 41.39,
   "line": 18,
   "sp": "A"
  }
 ],
